@startuml wave005_state
title Wave005 — healthy / degraded / offline
[*] --> EVALUATING
EVALUATING --> HEALTHY : selected online + utility high
EVALUATING --> DEGRADED : selected online + reduced floor
EVALUATING --> OFFLINE : offline fallback / unavailable
HEALTHY --> EVALUATING : telemetry update
DEGRADED --> EVALUATING : telemetry update
OFFLINE --> EVALUATING : candidate restored
note right of OFFLINE
  DIGITAL_SYNTHETIC_EVIDENCE
  no live carrier handover claim
end note
@enduml
